flowchart LR
    owner[Human job owner]
    git[Git pinned brief and context]
    orchestrator[Implicit Decision Gate]
    coder[Fresh Codex coding process]
    observer[Disposable behavior observer]
    reviewer[Fresh Codex evidence reviewer]
    store[Durable run store]
    verified[Return to wider verified loop]
    trust[Verified Loops trust controls]

    owner -->|Authoritative brief| git
    git -->|Pinned inputs| orchestrator
    orchestrator -->|Coding prompt| coder
    coder -->|Generated artifact| orchestrator
    orchestrator -->|Artifact and context| observer
    observer -->|Typed observed outcomes| orchestrator
    orchestrator -->|Brief and each outcome| reviewer
    reviewer -->|Evidence classifications| orchestrator
    orchestrator -->|Decision requests| owner
    owner -->|Typed owner decisions| orchestrator
    orchestrator -->|State prompts evidence artifacts| store
    orchestrator -->|Verified completion| verified
    trust -.->|Identity tools evidence permissions| orchestrator
